      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I possess information essential \r\nfor \"a certain plan.\" \r\nIt's related to the matter at hand.\r\nI'll be waiting at <STG 1001>.",
        "Jp" : "\"ある計画\"に必要な情報があってね\r\nそれに関わる案件なんだ\r\n<STG 1001> で待ってるよ"
