      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 21,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Now with its miniaturized form and toughness\r\nto endure explosive gunpowder,\r\nwe can finally implement \"that plan\"\r\nusing the \"Ripened bomb pumpkin!\"",
        "Jp" : "火薬の爆発に耐える固さと小型化が伴えば\r\n《熟成爆弾カボチャ》を使った\r\n\"あの計画\"がようやく実現できる！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 660517,
